<rml>
<head>
<title>Zegar peronowy</title>
<!--
Example (TSRE displays): a platform clock, beside the platform screen
(peron_lcd.rml).

Shapes: wyswietlacz_zegar_wiszacy_1.sd, _2.sd and
wyswietlacz_peron_zegar_wiszacy.sd: squares (340 x 500, Surface Glass,
RefreshRate 1, Input Clock) over the clock's part of each face's LCD.
With Input Clock the document has no platform or station: all the route's
clocks of this size share one, drawn once a second.

Shows: an analog clock whose hands turn by display.hours, minutes and
seconds (CSS transforms bound to them), the date under it (format_date,
the day's name in Polish).

Data binding and TSRE's functions; no Lua.
-->
<style>
body, div {
    display: block;
}
span {
    display: inline;
}
body {
    margin: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #050608;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: Noto Sans;
}

/* The clock: a face, twelve ticks, three hands. */
#face {
    position: absolute;
    left: 20px;
    top: 75px;
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    border-radius: 150px;
    background-color: #f2f2ee;
}
.tick {
    position: absolute;
    left: 147px;
    top: 0;
    width: 6px;
    height: 300px;
}
.tick div {
    height: 29px;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
}
/* The ticks after the top one, 30 degrees apart. */
.h1 {
    transform: rotate(30deg);
}
.h2 {
    transform: rotate(60deg);
}
.h3 {
    transform: rotate(90deg);
}
.h4 {
    transform: rotate(120deg);
}
.h5 {
    transform: rotate(150deg);
}
.h6 {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
}
.h7 {
    transform: rotate(210deg);
}
.h8 {
    transform: rotate(240deg);
}
.h9 {
    transform: rotate(270deg);
}
.h10 {
    transform: rotate(300deg);
}
.h11 {
    transform: rotate(330deg);
}
.hand {
    position: absolute;
    transform-origin: 50% 100%;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
}
#hour {
    left: 144px;
    top: 73px;
    width: 12px;
    height: 77px;
}
#minute {
    left: 146px;
    top: 30px;
    width: 8px;
    height: 120px;
}
#second {
    left: 148px;
    top: 21px;
    width: 4px;
    height: 129px;
    background-color: #c01818;
}
#pin {
    position: absolute;
    left: 141px;
    top: 141px;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
}
#date {
    position: absolute;
    left: 20px;
    top: 392px;
    width: 300px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 30px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body data-model="display">

<div id="face">
    <div class="tick"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h1"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h2"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h3"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h4"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h5"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h6"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h7"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h8"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h9"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h10"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h11"><div></div></div>
    <div class="hand" id="hour" data-style-transform="'rotate(' + (hours * 30 + minutes * 0.5) + 'deg)'"></div>
    <div class="hand" id="minute" data-style-transform="'rotate(' + (minutes * 6 + seconds * 0.1) + 'deg)'"></div>
    <div class="hand" id="second" data-style-transform="'rotate(' + seconds * 6 + 'deg)'"></div>
    <div id="pin"></div>
</div>
<div id="date">{{date | format_date('ddd dd.MM.yyyy', 'pl')}}</div>

</body>
</rml>
